Worksheet 1: Greetings & Introductions
Title: English Worksheet 1 - Greetings & Introductions
For Thai Students
Part A: Vocabulary Matching Match the English word with the Thai meaning:
1.  Hello          → A. ลาก่อน
2.  Goodbye        → B. สวัสดี
3.  Thank you      → C. ขอบคุณ
4.  Good morning   → D. อรุณสวัสดิ์
5.  Nice to meet you → E. ยินดีที่ได้รู้จัก
Part B: Fill in the blanks
1.  Good __________, teacher! (morning)
2.  __________ are you? (How)
3.  Nice to __________ you. (meet)
Part C: Writing Practice Write 5 sentences to introduce yourself: Example: Hello, my name is __________. I am from Thailand.